              ‘_R_O_O_T_/_v_a_r_/_c_a_c_h_e_/_g_n_u_p_g’ for internal cache files.


       ----wweeaakk--ddiiggeesstt nnaammee
              Treat the specified digest algorithm as weak.   Signatures  made
